    <h1>Creative Web Design in Connecticut</h1>

    <p>
      Mantis Digital Media is a Connecticut web design and creative digital studio based in Shelton, CT. We build modern, mobile-friendly websites for small businesses, contractors, artists, service companies, and growing brands that want to look professional, explain what they do clearly, and turn more visitors into leads.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our work combines web development, creative web design, SEO, AI search visibility, branding, custom graphics, and digital illustration. That means your website does not have to look like every other business website online. It can be clean, fast, professional, and still feel memorable.
    </p>

    <h2>Websites That Help Your Business Get Found</h2>

    <p>
      A good website should do more than sit online. It should help customers understand your services, trust your business, and contact you. We build websites with clear page structure, mobile-friendly layouts, fast loading performance, search-friendly content, and local SEO foundations designed to help Google and AI search platforms understand your business.
    </p>

    <h2>Web Design, Development, and Creative Visuals</h2>

    <p>
      Mantis Digital Media offers custom website design, website development, homepage redesigns, landing pages, SEO improvements, AI visibility updates, website maintenance, branding support, digital illustration, custom graphics, and character design. Whether you need a simple business website or a more creative online presence, we help bring your project to life.
    </p>

    <h2>Serving Businesses Across Connecticut</h2>

    <p>
      Located in Shelton, Connecticut, we work with businesses throughout Fairfield County, New Haven County, and across the state, including Shelton, Milford, Stratford, Bridgeport, Trumbull, Fairfield, Westport, Norwalk, Stamford, Greenwich, and New Haven. We also work remotely with clients nationwide.
